<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My Beloved responds:</l><l>Rise up my love,</l><l>My beauty and come away;</l><l>The rain is gone.</l><l>The winter is past,</l><l>The time of singing has come.</l><l>Rise up and come away,</l><l>You are my dove,</l><l>In the clefts of the rock.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>It’s just so difficult,</l><l>In these clefts to remain.</l><l>Naught but Your resurrection power</l><l>Could me sustain.</l><l>Now to Your call I respond,</l><l>From introspection to come.</l><l>Now and always, my Beloved,</l><l>I’d be Your dove,</l><l>In the clefts of the Rock.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
